3 Fronts 4v4 v1.0

4v4 map - each player will start on a seperate front. Each front is different. One is forest, another many building, and the centre front is mostly clear. 

2 Bombers to each player. No airfield on map.  All nations playable including japan who will play mostly as German.

Capture start zeppelin on each side to secure final reinforcments which come 40 minutes after start. 

Map and mission by iron.